    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 6.6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he man to deaþe gefylle, beo he þonne útlah, ⁊ his hente mid hearme ælc þara þe riht wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he strikes a man dead, he shall then be outlawed, and he shall be pursued with hostility by all those who wish to promote law and order.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he man to deaðe gefylle, beo he ðonne uthlah, ⁊ his hente mid hearme ælc ðara ðe riht wylle.</ab>
      </div>
